---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="Cosmology Cheat Sheet | Free Big Bang, Dark Matter, Dark Energy"
  description="Complete cosmology cheat sheet with Big Bang, dark matter, and dark energy. Free download for physics students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Cosmology<br><span>Cheat Sheet</span></h1>
    <p>Big Bang, dark matter, and dark energy. From the origin of the universe to its fate.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Big Bang Model</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Key Events</h3>
        <pre><code>t = 0&#58; Big Bang (singularity)
t = 10⁻⁴³ s&#58; Planck epoch
t = 10⁻³⁶ s&#58; inflation
t = 3 min&#58; nucleosynthesis
t = 380,000 yr&#58; recombination (CMB)
t = 200 Myr&#58; first stars
t = 13.8 Gyr&#58; today</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Hubble's Law</h3>
        <pre><code>v = H₀d
v&#58; recession velocity
d&#58; distance
H₀ = 70 km/s/Mpc = 2.27 × 10⁻¹⁸ s⁻¹</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Composition</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Energy Budget</h3>
        <pre><code>Dark energy&#58; 68%
Dark matter&#58; 27%
Ordinary matter&#58; 5%
Radiation&#58; < 0.01%</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Dark Matter</h3>
        <pre><code>Does not emit/absorb light
Gravitational effects observed
Candidates&#58; WIMPs, axions, MACHOs
Evidence&#58; galaxy rotation curves, CMB, gravitational lensing</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Dark Energy</h3>
        <pre><code>Accelerating expansion
Cosmological constant Λ
Equation of state&#58; w = -1
Energy density&#58; ρ_Λ ≈ 5.96 × 10⁻²⁷ kg/m³</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Cosmic Microwave Background</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>CMB Properties</h3>
        <pre><code>Temperature&#58; 2.725 K
Blackbody spectrum
Anisotropies&#58; ΔT/T ≈ 10⁻⁵
Provides evidence for Big Bang
Encodes information about early universe</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Fate of the Universe</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Possible Scenarios</h3>
        <pre><code>Big Freeze&#58; dark energy dominates
Big Crunch&#58; gravity reverses expansion
Big Rip&#58; dark energy destroys everything
Big Bounce&#58; cyclic model</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
